1
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:48,100
I'm so hungry.

2
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:11,289
Here are your buns.

3
00:01:14,360 --> 00:01:16,220
Someone is giving away free buns.

4
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:17,660
Then I won't hold back.

5
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,560
Where did this blind fool come from,

6
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,860
daring to block my way?

7
00:01:53,630 --> 00:01:54,530
How strange.

8
00:02:11,030 --> 00:02:11,690
Miss! Miss!

9
00:02:12,130 --> 00:02:14,060
Take a look at the newly arrived peach blossom rouge.

10
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:15,460
It applies evenly and lasts long.

11
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:17,520
It suits a beauty like you perfectly.

12
00:02:20,260 --> 00:02:20,860
Thank you,

13
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:22,260
but I have no money.

14
00:02:22,630 --> 00:02:23,030
Miss,

15
00:02:23,260 --> 00:02:24,390
feel free to choose.

16
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:27,960
Once you've picked, just let the gentleman behind you pay.

17
00:02:30,700 --> 00:02:31,360
Gentleman?

18
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:32,630
What...

19
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:33,600
What gentleman?

20
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,960
I saw that gentleman in black

21
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:37,260
following you all the way.

22
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:38,100
Hiding behind trees

23
00:02:38,100 --> 00:02:38,760
and walls.

24
00:02:39,060 --> 00:02:39,990
Look back, miss.

25
00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:41,829
He must be a doting sweetheart.

26
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:56,900
There's no one.

27
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,000
You must be mistaken.

28
00:02:59,530 --> 00:03:00,300
Hey.

29
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:02,060
He was just there,

30
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:04,530
hiding behind that old locust tree.

31
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:06,600
How strange.

32
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:09,320
A living person just vanished into thin air.

33
00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:32,560
What a coincidence, my wife.

34
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,360
Just passing by.

35
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,420
Purely passing by.

36
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:35,260
Passing by?

37
00:03:36,100 --> 00:03:37,960
You were squatting behind the umbrella stand,

38
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,420
holding a leaky umbrella.

39
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,200
Isn't it raining?

40
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,490
I'm taking shelter.

41
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:48,260
This umbrella...

42
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:49,730
I was just planning to buy it.

43
00:03:49,730 --> 00:03:50,700
Checking the styles

44
00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:51,560
and testing the rain protection.

45
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,030
Sir,

46
00:03:52,430 --> 00:03:54,230
you've been squatting here for half an hour,

47
00:03:54,230 --> 00:03:55,860
just holding the umbrella without buying.

48
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:57,130
Just now, you were across the street,

49
00:03:57,130 --> 00:03:58,430
climbing walls and sneaking into alleys.

50
00:03:58,430 --> 00:03:59,630
I saw it all.

51
00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:00,520
Shut up.

52
00:04:01,430 --> 00:04:04,090
No one will think you're mute if you don't speak.

53
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:10,190
Stop squatting.

54
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:10,860
Let's go.

55
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,100
My wife, you're not driving me away?

56
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:15,460
You're not drawing a line with me anymore?

57
00:04:15,460 --> 00:04:17,519
Suit yourself if you don't want to go.

58
00:04:19,529 --> 00:04:20,589
Let's go, let's go.

59
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:21,300
I must go.

60
00:04:21,459 --> 00:04:22,590
Wait for me, my wife.

61
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:34,130
This secret protection was worth it.

62
00:04:34,130 --> 00:04:35,700
Getting a little wet is nothing.

63
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:37,060
I'll enshrine this umbrella later.

64
00:04:37,060 --> 00:04:39,460
It's the umbrella of merit for our reunion.

65
00:04:49,260 --> 00:04:50,060
Your Majesty,

66
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:51,230
it has been confirmed.

67
00:04:51,230 --> 00:04:52,430
That spiritual energy fluctuation

68
00:04:52,430 --> 00:04:54,230
came from the mortal realm's God of War, Baili.

69
00:04:54,230 --> 00:04:55,300
After repeated comparisons,

70
00:04:55,300 --> 00:04:57,200
it matches the characteristics of the ancient divine vein.

71
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:58,030
I suspect

72
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:00,200
that besides the divine bone,

73
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:03,230
the ancient divine vein is also hidden in her body.

74
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,760
No wonder even after her divine bone was extracted,

75
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:07,560
she survived in the Demon Realm.

76
00:05:09,060 --> 00:05:11,060
No wonder after falling into the mortal realm,

77
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:13,190
her spiritual energy still flickers.

78
00:05:13,800 --> 00:05:14,730
I always thought

79
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:18,560
she was just lingering on with residual immortal energy.

80
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,360
Your Majesty.

81
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:22,030
If the ancient divine veins can serve you,

82
00:05:22,030 --> 00:05:24,300
why worry that the Six Realms won't submit?

83
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:26,560
Bai Li only has Cang Yuan by her side now.

84
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:28,400
If we can control him,

85
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:29,930
Bai Li will have no way out.

86
00:05:34,060 --> 00:05:35,190
Pass down the order.

87
00:05:35,530 --> 00:05:38,860
I will personally lead the troops to attack the Demon Realm.

88
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,100
Cang Yuan,

89
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,860
you think someone like you

90
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:42,960
can compete with me?
